  {
    "id": 6901001090010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！\r\n『W.I.N.G.』優勝、本当におめでとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6901001090010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "私も会場で見てたんですけど、\r\n発表の瞬間、思わず大声を出しちゃいましたよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6901001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "今もまだ興奮しちゃってて、\r\n今日はもう眠れそうにありません！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6901001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、はづきさん！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "本当によくやった\r\n期待以上の結果を出してくれたな",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6902001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "社長も……ありがとうございます！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ふふ。私と社長も会場に来てましたけど、\r\nすごかったですよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6901001090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "優勝したってわかった瞬間、社長が泣いてしまって……\r\nステージをほとんど見れていませんでしたから",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6901001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "こ、こら！\r\n彼の前でそういうことを言うな！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6902001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "それだけ優勝したのを\r\n喜んでたってことじゃないですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6901001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "そ、それはそうだが……",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6902001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "社長、本当にありがとうございます！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……とにかく。もっと礼を言うべき相手、\r\nいや、祝うべき相手がいるんじゃないか",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6902001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうですね\r\n今日の主役は、他でもない彼女ですから",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "なら、私たちのことは気にせず\r\n早く行ってこい",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6902001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "彼女のこと、いっぱい\r\n褒めてあげてくださいねー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6901001090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はい！　もちろんです！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "bgEffect": "mask",
    "bg": "00016",
    "bgm": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ああ、真乃だ\r\n公園にいるなんて……初めて会った頃みたいだな）",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bgm": "008",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090010,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やったな、真乃\r\nいいステージだった",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\nあの最後のステージ……今までで一番うまく歌えました",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "灯織ちゃん、めぐるちゃんとひとつに繋がれたみたいな\r\n不思議な感覚……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "よかった、最後のステージであれができて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "１位にふさわしい本当に最高のステージだったよ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "１位……１位なんですね\r\nまだ……ピンときませんけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも、ファンのみなさんが喜んでくれたことが\r\n何より一番うれしいですっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんが褒めてくれることも",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……真乃らしいな",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ、何かおかしなこと言っちゃいましたか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ごめんな、そうじゃない\r\n勲章よりも周りの人たちのことを考えるのが真乃らしくて",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱり、癒しのアイドルなんだなって、\r\nそう思った",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "癒し……みんなそう言ってくれます\r\nいつまで経っても実感が持てないんですけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090090"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも……もし私がみなさんを癒せてるなら……\r\nそれは間違いなくうれしいですっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、その調子だ\r\n癒そうと思わないからこそ癒せるのが櫻木真乃だからな",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そうなんですね\r\nプロデューサーさんが言うならきっとそうです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、ずっと見てきたから\r\n真乃のことはわかってるつもりだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私……自分がアイドルとしてやっていけるのか\r\nなかなか自信が持てませんでした……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも、プロデューサーさんは\r\nずっとサポートしてくれましたよね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁね、できるだけのことはしたつもりだよ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "おかげで私は、あのステージに立てました\r\n灯織ちゃん、めぐるちゃんという素敵な仲間と一緒に",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、プロデューサーさん\r\nここまで私を連れてきてくれて",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだまだこれからだよ、真乃",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ふふ……そうでした\r\nこれで終わった気になっちゃダメですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日はステージの余韻に浸っていよう\r\n明日からはまた一歩ずつ前へ進んでいくんだ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\n私、どこまでも飛んでいきたいです",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090170"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "それで、できるだけ多くの人に笑顔を届けたい……\r\nほわほわってなってもらいたいです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃なら望めば望んだだけのことができるよ",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわわわ……ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090190"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも私は……プロデューサーさんの手助けがないと\r\n羽ばたくこともできません",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090200"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090210,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……羽ばたけないと大変です",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090210"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "応援してくれるみなさんに応えるためにも\r\n飛び続けないと",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、これからも真乃をサポートしていくからな",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6001001090230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\nよろしくお願いしますね、プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600100109/6001001090230"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]